  "body": "If value, quality and a motivated vendor sound like your kind of opportunity, stop scrolling and bring us an offer. 6 Taitonga Lane offers low-maintenance living without compromising on space. Built in 2023 and sitting in an end position on a 322sqm freehold site, this four-bedroom home delivers all the ease of near-new living - without feeling like your typical townhouse.\r\n\r\nAt 192sqm, there's room here for families to spread out. The open-plan kitchen, dining and living area forms the heart of the home, flowing easily outdoors to a fully fenced section where kids and pets can play, summer BBQs can stretch into the evening, and weekends aren't swallowed up by garden maintenance.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n* Solid 2023 GJ Gardner build with balance of a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n* Fully fenced, freehold 322sqm site - no body corporate fees\r\n* Generous 192sqm floor area - light-filled and surprisingly spacious\r\n* Four supersized double bedrooms, two bathrooms + guest toilet\r\n* Sleek, well-designed kitchen with gas hob\r\n* Beautiful tiled bathrooms with underfloor heating\r\n* Two heat pumps for year-round comfort\r\n* Internal-access tandem garage\r\n* End townhouse offering extra privacy and space\r\n* Secure, easy-care living - lock up and leave with confidence\r\n\r\nPositioned in the heart of Stanmore Bay, you've got everything right where you need it. Cafes, parks, shops and transport links are all close by, with the beach just minutes away for those morning walks or evening unwinds. With great schooling options and the added convenience of Penlink on the way, this is a location that continues to grow in all the right ways.\r\n\r\nGet in touch today, we'd love to show you through.\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents please visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/DKN2\r\n\r\n- Flexible settlement terms available\r\n- Other agents bring your buyers, conjunctionals welcome",
